{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>And it did not stink.</b> From here is a hint and a support that the dead have rest on the Sabbath. And in all of Scripture the word ורמה ('and it stank') appears only twice: one is (Job 24:26) ״ורמה תכסה עליהם״, and the second is ״ורמה לא היתה בו״ — and this is to hint: ״ורמה תכסה עליהם״ — on the rest of the days of the week, and ״ורמה לא היתה בו״ — on the Sabbath."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {0 "The citation איוב כ״א:כ״ו points to Job 21:26, but chapter 21 has only 34 verses and no such phrase; the quoted words ורמה תכסה עליהם are not found in the Book of Job at all. Printed citation apparently corrupt; the reference cannot be resolved."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:00:10.171294348Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}